Parallel Stream:
------>
helps to perform operation on stream concurrently
taking advantage of mutli core CPU

Internally:
--->
Task Splitting
Task Submission 
----> uses Fork-Join Technique


main diff in implementation is 
.stream()
.parallelstream()


Both produces the same output
The
only difference is 

Difference in time

For example using 
stream() the time taken is 64 millisecond
for 
parallelStream() the time taken is 5 millisecond



